 684+ 83ED 3A 53 B1         ld   a, (high_score + 0)
 685+ 83F0 B8               cp   b
 686+ 83F1 30 12            jr   nc, .done_check       ; se high_score+0 >= player_score+0 -> nessun aggiornamento
